# Seed for the cowrie replay-bot drop map (TALOS-hdw8). Intentionally EMPTY.
#
# haproxy needs the file to exist at startup, but the live contents are maintained
# entirely in memory by the haproxy-novelty-bouncer sidecar over the admin socket
# (`add map` / `del map`). Nothing is ever written back here, so a pod restart
# starts from an empty map and the bouncer refills it on its next poll.
#
# Format when populated at runtime: "<ip> 1" per line.
